  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 623a3d2527136184fa4ea8e3453ea0b8, type: 3}
  m_Name: ConfidenceDialogue_Production
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::FirstJobber.ConfidenceDialogueDatabase
  threshold: 50
  days:
  - day: 1
    high:
    - id: candidate_00
      dialogue:
        speaker: Player
        text: Wow! Look at my profile! How could a game company possibly pass up someone as talented as me?!
        dialogueLines: []
        emotion: 0
        autoAdvanceDelay: 0
        delayBefore: 0
        eventId: 
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        genderIds: []
        variantGroup: 
    - id: candidate_01
      dialogue:
        speaker: Player
        text: All right, this is the one! My first job is going to be great!
        dialogueLines: []
        emotion: 0
        autoAdvanceDelay: 0
        delayBefore: 0
        eventId: 
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        genderIds: []
        variantGroup: 
    - id: candidate_02
      dialogue:
        speaker: Player
        text: Just send it already!!
        dialogueLines: []
        emotion: 0
        autoAdvanceDelay: 0
        delayBefore: 0
        eventId: 
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        genderIds: []
        variantGroup: 
    low:
    - id: candidate_00
      dialogue:
        speaker: Player
        text: Uh... come to think of it, my profile doesn't really stand out that much...
        dialogueLines: []
        emotion: 0
        autoAdvanceDelay: 0
        delayBefore: 0
        eventId: 
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        genderIds: []
        variantGroup: 
    - id: candidate_01
      dialogue:
        speaker: Player
        text: Would this company even be interested in me? Or will they open my resume and close it right away...
        dialogueLines: []
        emotion: 0
        autoAdvanceDelay: 0
        delayBefore: 0
        eventId: 
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        genderIds: []
        variantGroup: 
    - id: candidate_02
      dialogue:
        speaker: Player
        text: But you never know until you try!
        dialogueLines: []
        emotion: 0
        autoAdvanceDelay: 0
        delayBefore: 0
        eventId: 
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        genderIds: []
        variantGroup: 
    - id: candidate_03
      dialogue:
        speaker: Player
        text: I may not be fully confident, but I really do want to work in games!
        dialogueLines: []
        emotion: 0
        autoAdvanceDelay: 0
        delayBefore: 0
        eventId: 
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        genderIds: []
        variantGroup: 
    - id: candidate_04
      dialogue:
        speaker: Player
        text: Let's go! At least I have to give myself a chance first!
        dialogueLines: []
        emotion: 0
        autoAdvanceDelay: 0
        delayBefore: 0
        eventId: 
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        genderIds: []
        variantGroup: 
  - day: 2
    high:
    - id: candidate_00
      dialogue:
        speaker: Player
        text: All right! Maybe the last company just wasn't the right place for me! My skills aren't bad at all. This company must have something good for me!
        dialogueLines: []
        emotion: 0
        autoAdvanceDelay: 0
        delayBefore: 0
        eventId: 
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        genderIds: []
        variantGroup: 
    low:
    - id: candidate_00
      dialogue:
        speaker: Player
        text: Ah... I have to send it again, huh. I hope I don't get rejected too quickly this time...
        dialogueLines: []
        emotion: 0
        autoAdvanceDelay: 0
        delayBefore: 0
        eventId: 
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        genderIds: []
        variantGroup: 
    - id: candidate_01
      dialogue:
        speaker: Player
        text: Oh well, let's give it a try.
        dialogueLines: []
        emotion: 0
        autoAdvanceDelay: 0
        delayBefore: 0
        eventId: 
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        genderIds: []
        variantGroup: 
  - day: 3
    high:
    - id: candidate_00
      dialogue:
        speaker: Player
        text: My work isn't bad, and I have the skills. So what's still missing?
        dialogueLines: []
        emotion: 0
        autoAdvanceDelay: 0
        delayBefore: 0
        eventId: 
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        genderIds: []
        variantGroup: 
    - id: candidate_01
      dialogue:
        speaker: Player
        text: Whatever, just send it for now. Soon I'll find out what excuse they come up with this time to turn me down.
        dialogueLines: []
        emotion: 0
        autoAdvanceDelay: 0
        delayBefore: 0
        eventId: 
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        genderIds: []
        variantGroup: 
    low:
    - id: candidate_00
      dialogue:
        speaker: Player
        text: Same resume, same portfolio, same questions... It feels like I'm doing everything over and over. The only differences are the company name and the rejection I'm about to get...
        dialogueLines: []
        emotion: 0
        autoAdvanceDelay: 0
        delayBefore: 0
        eventId: 
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        genderIds: []
        variantGroup: 
  - day: 4
    high:
    - id: candidate_00
      dialogue:
        speaker: Player
        text: Yeah, I'm good, and I know it... So what? In the end I still have to sit here applying for jobs like always. Ha ha...
        dialogueLines: []
        emotion: 0
        autoAdvanceDelay: 0
        delayBefore: 0
        eventId: 
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        genderIds: []
        variantGroup: 
    - id: candidate_01
      dialogue:
        speaker: Player
        text: Fine, just send it so the day can be over.
        dialogueLines: []
        emotion: 0
        autoAdvanceDelay: 0
        delayBefore: 0
        eventId: 
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        genderIds: []
        variantGroup: 
    low:
    - id: candidate_00
      dialogue:
        speaker: Player
        text: ...I don't even want to look at my resume anymore.
        dialogueLines: []
        emotion: 0
        autoAdvanceDelay: 0
        delayBefore: 0
        eventId: 
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        genderIds: []
        variantGroup: 
    - id: candidate_01
      dialogue:
        speaker: Player
        text: But if I don't send it, there's no job, no money, and I'll keep worrying about the same things... I'm so tired.
        dialogueLines: []
        emotion: 0
        autoAdvanceDelay: 0
        delayBefore: 0
        eventId: 
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        genderIds: []
        variantGroup: 
  - day: 5
    high:
    - id: candidate_00
      dialogue:
        speaker: Player
        text: I've done well all along... I studied hard, built my portfolio, trained myself for so many years.
        dialogueLines: []
        emotion: 0
        autoAdvanceDelay: 0
        delayBefore: 0
        eventId: 
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        genderIds: []
        variantGroup: 
    - id: candidate_01
      dialogue:
        speaker: Player
        text: So why is it so hard just to find a job somewhere?
        dialogueLines: []
        emotion: 0
        autoAdvanceDelay: 0
        delayBefore: 0
        eventId: 
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        genderIds: []
        variantGroup: 
    - id: candidate_02
      dialogue:
        speaker: Player
        text: ...Yeah, forget it. Just send it, so I finally find out what reason they'll reject me for this time.
        dialogueLines: []
        emotion: 0
        autoAdvanceDelay: 0
        delayBefore: 0
        eventId: 
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        genderIds: []
        variantGroup: 
    low:
    - id: candidate_00
      dialogue:
        speaker: Player
        text: Do I have to do this again?... Pick a company, attach my portfolio, write my resume, and then sit and wait...
        dialogueLines: []
        emotion: 0
        autoAdvanceDelay: 0
        delayBefore: 0
        eventId: 
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        genderIds: []
        variantGroup: 
    - id: candidate_01
      dialogue:
        speaker: Player
        text: I don't even know if anyone will open it once I send it.
        dialogueLines: []
        emotion: 0
        autoAdvanceDelay: 0
        delayBefore: 0
        eventId: 
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        genderIds: []
        variantGroup: 
    - id: candidate_02
      dialogue:
        speaker: Player
        text: ...But if I don't send it, I'll just have to come back and do this again tomorrow.
        dialogueLines: []
        emotion: 0
        autoAdvanceDelay: 0
        delayBefore: 0
        eventId: 
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        genderIds: []
        variantGroup: 
  fallbackHigh: []
  fallbackLow: []
